      "message": "Updated according to the above comment:\n1. commands are not queued. \n2. Added DISABLING state, it blocks setEnabled(true), join(), scheduleMigration() calls with the existing ERROR_THREAD_DISABLED error.\n3. Updated docs to explain the disabling state.\n\nAfter the updates, the OutcomeReceiver onResult means operation is started and not necessarily completed, updated in docs.",
